Tool response:
Tool: find_appointments
Description: Retrieve all appointments for the current user, filtered by date and time if specified.
Returns appointment details including ID, doctor information, and status.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "date": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Filter appointments by date (YYYY-MM-DD format)",
          "title": "Date"
        },
        "time": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Filter appointments by time (HH:MM format)",
          "title": "Time"
        }
      },
      "required": []
    }

Tool response:
Tool: cancel_appointment
Description: Update the status of an appointment to 'cancelled'. Only the owner of the appointment can cancel it.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "ID of the appointment to cancel",
          "title": "Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: schedule_followup
Description: Create a new appointment for the current user with the specified doctor at the given datetime.
The appointment will be marked as 'scheduled'.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "doctor_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Doctor Id"
        },
        "appointment_datetime": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Appointment Datetime"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "doctor_id",
        "appointment_datetime"
      ]
    }
